# Trivy vulnerability allowlist for the security-scan workflow (issue #311).
#
# Every entry here MUST have a comment above it recording: the CVE, why it's
# allowlisted (no fix available / not reachable / false positive), and the
# date it was added — see docs/security-triage.md for the full process.

# CVE-2026-78667, CVE-2026-78669, CVE-2026-97031 — Go stdlib HTTP/2 and TLS advisories
# present in Go 1.25.x; services/api runs behind an ingress reverse proxy and does not
# expose raw TLS or unbuffered HTTP/2 directly.
# Added 2026-10-21, re-review by 2027-01-21.
CVE-2026-78667
CVE-2026-78669
CVE-2026-97031

# CVE-2026-13221, CVE-2026-42496, CVE-2026-8376, CVE-2026-42497, CVE-2026-48962, CVE-2026-57432, CVE-2026-57433
# Debian base image perl-base utility vulnerabilities; Perl is not invoked or reachable
# in the indexer or gRPC API runtime images.
