CVE-2026-13221
CVE-2026-42496
CVE-2026-8376
CVE-2026-42497
CVE-2026-48962
CVE-2026-57432
CVE-2026-57433

# CVE-2026-56851 — golang.org/x/text v0.40.0 DoS via malformed input.
# Bumped to v0.41.0 in go.mod (fix available). Entry kept here until go.sum
# is updated and image rebuilt. Re-review after next CI green run.
# Added 2026-10-22.
CVE-2026-56851

# CVE-2026-84304 — google.golang.org/grpc v1.82.1 DoS via large headers.
# Fix is in v1.83.1 (feature-level minor bump, tracked separately from v1.82.2 patch).
# CVE-2026-84445 (same package, same series) is fixed by v1.82.2 (already bumped).
# Added 2026-10-22, re-review by 2027-01-22.
CVE-2026-84304

# CVE-2026-111943 — Go stdlib crypto/x509 mitigation present only in Go 1.26.10 / 1.27.3.
# The Dockerfile is pinned to Go 1.25 (matching the go.mod toolchain line); upgrading
# to 1.26 requires a separate build-toolchain PR. Not reachable in our deployment behind
# an ingress TLS terminator. Added 2026-10-22, re-review by 2027-01-22.
CVE-2026-111943
